The skills in this directory are adapted from Superpowers by Jesse Vincent (https://github.com/obra/superpowers):
using-onionsoup-skills from using-superpowers; brainstorming, writing-plans, subagent-driven-development,
executing-plans, requesting-code-review, receiving-code-review, systematic-debugging, test-driven-development
and verification-before-completion from the skills of the same names, with their supporting files. They were
changed for onionsoup: owners, desks, onionsoup tools and host gates replace worktrees, commits, scripts and
ledger files, and parts that do not apply here were removed.

